  "script": "看，一只小鸟。晨光直直的。念，一。这就是一。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "concrete-anchor",
      "text": "看，一只小鸟。",
      "role": "concrete-anchor",
      "targetCharOccurrences": 1,
      "shotIdHint": "dawn-valley",
      "notes": "silent prologue 后第一句旁白，直接邀请孩子去看。复用 v5 cinematic 已有的远景小鸟 6 帧 sprite（transparentPixelRatio 0.9446），bird sprite 在 dawn-valley 段持续出现以与「一只小鸟」音画同框。一只 = 可数 1 个，给 number-as-numeral 一个具象锚点，规避 v5 一道光量词无视觉锚的硬伤。v6 砍 scene-setup「天亮了」是为了让 spoken body ≤8s 上限（audio-plan validator 硬约束）；删掉解说式开场反而强化 cinematic silent-prologue 美学。"
    },
    {
      "id": "phrase-bridge",
      "text": "晨光直直的。",
      "role": "phrase-bridge",
      "targetCharOccurrences": 0,
      "shotIdHint": "light-band",
      "notes": "把 light-band 横光的字形特征用「直直的」点出来，不再用「一道光」量词蹭次数，让 light-band → 一横的视觉过渡承担字形语义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "glyph-naming",
      "text": "念，一。",
      "role": "glyph-naming",
      "targetCharOccurrences": 1,
      "shotIdHint": "ink-glyph",
      "notes": "ink-glyph 渗墨到 ~50% 时口播读出字音；明确 glyph-naming 角色，给孩子字-音绑定钩。"
    },
    {
      "id": "extension",
      "text": "这就是一。",
      "role": "extension",
      "targetCharOccurrences": 1,
      "shotIdHint": "ink-glyph-dwell",
      "notes": "ink-glyph 完整态 dwell 时收束，第 3 次读出「一」让重复达标。后接静默笔顺尾段（米字格 writing 态）。"
    }
  ],
  "concreteAnchorPhrase": {
    "segmentId": "concrete-anchor",
